### Aggregate Customer Preferences
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/preferences/aggregate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "records": [
    {
      "customerId": "A12",
      "email": "John.Doe+mobile@Example.com",
      "language": "EN",
      "marketingOptIn": true,
      "preferredCategories": ["tech", "books"]
    },
    {
      "customerId": "A12",
      "email": "john.doe@example.com",
      "language": "en-US",
      "marketingOptIn": false,
      "preferredCategories": ["books", "sports"]
    },
    {
      "customerId": "B55",
      "email": "maria@example.es",
      "language": "ES",
      "marketingOptIn": true,
      "preferredCategories": ["fashion"]
    }
  ]
}
